This directory contains include files for running Amos II embedded in
C applications using Borland C++:

storage.h   Include file defining Amos II basic storage interfaces.
callin.h    Include file for callin interface.
callout.h   Include file for callout interface. 

---------------
The following files contain demonstration C programs embedded
with Amos II:

amosdemo.c  Demonstrates callin interface from C to Amos II.
calloutdemo.c   
callout.amosql
            Demonstrates callout interface from Amos II to C.

---------------
The following files contain Borland C++ Builder project definitions for
running the C demo applications:

demo.cpp
demo.mak    Project definition for callin demo.

callout.cpp
callout.mak Project definitions for callout demo.

To compile all demo programs run the command procedure
   compile.cmd

---------------
The MicroSoft Visual Studio definitions for the above projects 
are in the subdirectory ../demo.
